e made significant  progress on their dissertation  um i think that's unfortunate because  that can lead to a lot of wasted effort  in a in various directions  and actually by checking in with us  frequently  uh that actually allows us to to update  our beliefs so so one meeting in which  you didn't have uh your work done you  know it's absolutely fine as long as you  check with us you know regularly in  future months and throughout the year  and we can see the progress of the  project  great well i want to thank you all um  for your incredibly wise and judicious  advice today and just for being so  gracious with your time and insights  um and i also want to thank everyone who  participated in the conversation with  the questions through the chat um we i  should say that we do intend to post the  recording of the conversation on youtube  so um we'll get that link out to folks  soon  um and yes thank you all for being here  we really appreciate it and we look  forward to seeing you again soon
 

